# Diagnosis only (dolpic/0 dev start, Null backend, dev cheats, tp and the dev-only hold token `aimhead`): kill the Delfino GateKeeper (boss at (12,300,4631)) with the water jet only; flag 0x10384 is the goal.
# Squat (L) + stick BACK raises the nozzle; sweep over distance and stick strength.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
cheat infinite_health
cheat infinite_water
cheat unlock_nozzles
wait frames=60
log
tp x=12 y=320 z=5271 yaw=180
wait frames=6
hold L trig=255,255 stick=0,-50 aimhead frames=60
log
tp x=12 y=320 z=5271 yaw=180
wait frames=6
hold L trig=255,255 stick=0,-80 aimhead frames=60
log
